$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Cu-Mn Spinel Oxide Catalyzed Regioselective Halogenation of Phenols and
N-Heteroarenes
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
