$DATUM To a solution of 10a (430 mg, 0.77 mmol) in DCE (20 mL) TFA (0.5 mL)
andNIS (261 mg, 1.16 mmol) were added. The mixture was stirred for 1 hour
at 60°Cand then washed with water (2×10 mL). The organic phase was dried
over Na2SO4 and the solvent evaporated in vacuo. The residue was purified
by column chromatography (20 g of silica gel, DCM→DCM-MeOH, 9:1). 13a
(404 mg) as a white powder. Yield 77%. m.p. 118-120°C; R f (A) 0.44; MS
(ESI) m/z [M+H]+ calcd 682.1; found 682.2.
