$DATUM 4,5-Dichloro-7-[2-deoxy-3,5-bis-O-(2-methylpropanoyl)-β
-Derythro-pentofuranosyl]-2-(formylamino)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine
(8a); Typical Procedure To a solution of compound 7 (1.1 g, 2.43 mmol) in
DMF (30 mL) was added N-chlorosuccinimide (390 mg, 2.92 mmol). After
stirring for 24 h at 50 °C, the reaction mixture was evaporated to
dryness, redissolved in CH2Cl2 and chromatographed (silica gel, column 4
× 12 cm, A → B). From the main zone, a colorless foam was obtained.
Crystallization from CH2Cl2-petroleum ether (2:1). Colorless crystals,
yield 900 mg, 76%. Mp 127 °C; TLC (silica gel, B): Rf = 0.42. 1H NMR
(DMSO-d6): δ = 1.06 (d, 6 H, J= 6.9 Hz, 2 CH3), 1.13 (d, 6 H, J = 6.9 Hz,
2 CH3), 2.50-2.64 (m, 3 H, 2 CH, H-2'), 2.86-2.94 (m, 1 H, H-2'),
4.18-4.28 (m, 3 H, H-4', 2 H-5'), 5.35-5.37 (m, H-3'), 6.52 (t, 1 H, J=
6.8, 6.8 Hz, H-1'), 7.93 (s, 1 H, H-6), 9.37 (d, 1 H, J= 9.5 Hz, NH),
11.21 (d, 1 H, J= 9.5 Hz, HCO). UV (MeOH): λmax (ε) = 248 nm (38100).
Anal. Calcd for C20H24Cl2N4O6 (487.3): C, 49.29; H, 4.96; N, 11.50.
Found: C, 49.29; H, 4.90; N, 11.33.
